flowchart LR
    VN[Hyperliquid testnet exports] --> RAW[Bounded raw evidence]
    EX[Execution journal and audit] --> RAW
    SE[Sentinel audit and metrics] --> RAW
    OP[Process, kill, and mount inspection] --> RAW

    RAW --> MAN[Hash-bound run manifest]
    MAN --> COL[Credential-free acceptance assembler]
    SC[15 typed scenario records] --> COL
    FS[Final flat venue state] --> COL
    OF[Reviewed operational facts] --> COL

    COL --> OBS[Canonical testnet observation]
    OBS --> EV[Frozen-policy evaluator]
    EV -->|fail| HALT[Retain evidence and investigate]
    EV -->|pass| REVIEW[Independent human review]
    REVIEW --> BUNDLE[Unsigned release preparation]

    COL -. no network, wallet, or signer .-> HALT
    EV -. cannot sign, admit, or deploy .-> HALT
